Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 21:25:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] BUDGET-SCAN-4: undoing a schedule's split refuses lines on an
 envelope gone since

It restored lines naming a merged or deleted envelope, so the next Mark paid
was refused; where the envelope's row was gone, the undo failed on its
foreign key. Found by the budget fuzzer.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
